id: pm-by83yj
title: Core external-reference refusal recommends a flag absent from the CLI lexicon
description: "Current checkout create --stdin-json refuses an external_ref field as core_item_field_requires_dedicated_flag and recommends pm update <id> --external-ref <value>. Following that recovery fails because --external-ref is declared nowhere, including update. The refusal cannot supply its promised recovery."
